  m_Name: Rayo_W49_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Rayo
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 375a2426790ffd84aa1a9c7758ba6b06, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'Click! Nasayaat a pose!


    Napudot ita nga aldaw, ket nalabit
    a kayatmo ti maysa a makapresko.


    Iti Ilokano, ti ''uminom'' ket kayatna
    a saoen ti ''drink.''


    Maysa dayta nga action verb nga agusar no pagsasaritaan
    ti panaginom iti maysa a banag.


    Denggem a naimbag: uminom.


    Ita, padasem
    nga ibagam ti ''uminom'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'Click! Great pose!

    It''s warm today, and you might want something
    refreshing.

    In Ilokano, ''uminom'' means ''drink.''

    It is an action
    verb used when talking about drinking something.

    Now, try saying ''uminom''
    yourself.'
